From: roc-native-macos engine patch series
Subject: [PATCH 0006] Count the rows a table view keeps, on its parent
Upstream: not yet sent
Applies to: roc-signals a13ff70e + 0001 + 0002 + 0003 + 0004 + 0005,
  platform/Core.roc and platform/Engine.roc

What
  `table_view_counted(table, props, name, template)`, in Core and
  Engine: a `table_view` that also sets the attribute `name` of its
  parent element to the number of rows its query keeps, in decimal
  (`ATTR parent name count`), at mount and in each pass that changes
  that number. `table_view` is `table_view_counted` with an empty name,
  which sets nothing, so every existing view emits exactly what it did.
  The site's fixed record (`Shows`) carries the name, and a pass reads
  the view's length (`View.len`, the ordered keys' count) before
  `follow`, as it already reads the window, and compares it after
  `draw`.

Why
  A view's window draws `count` rows from `start`; nothing outside the
  site knew how many rows the query keeps, which a list that draws a
  small window needs to size its scroller for every row. An app could
  count with a reader of the table and the query, but that is a pass
  over the table on every write and every keystroke; the site already
  holds the count. With it, `Ui.table_list` windows the view to the
  rows near those in sight (its own `Engine.state` holds the window, and
  the host asks for a new one as the user scrolls), and the host sizes
  the `NSTableView` from the attribute.

Measured (bench/rows, Apple M-series, RC1, a loaded machine, before
0004 and 0005; `Ui.list`
over `every_row` against `Ui.table_list`, in the same build; ms)
                                  N=10,000      N=100,000     N=1,000,000
  mount engine, every row             18           173          2,130
  mount engine, windowed             2.6            16            211
  mount apply, every row              21           100          1,120
  mount apply, windowed              7.5             9            8.2
  clear filter engine, every row      18           239          2,289
  clear filter engine, windowed      0.3           1.6             11
  peak RSS (MB), every row           137           285          1,569
  peak RSS (MB), windowed            109           170            366
  A view that is not counted reads one more field per pass.

